{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "cabinet",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🌿 **CABINET**\n**用户知识库**\n\n**内容:**\n- 📂 daily, projects, knowledge, research, archive\n- 📝 回忆录素材\n\n**特点:**\n- Human Only (AI只读)\n- AI生成草稿进入 runtime/drafts/ 后 Human 审核\n- 可单独在 Obsidian 打开",
      "x": -800,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "system",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⚖️ **SYSTEM**\n**系统架构库**\n\n**内容:**\n- 📜 AI-OB Constitution\n- 🤖 Cursor Rules\n- 🏗️ Architecture Blueprints\n- 🛡️ Schemas / Workflows\n\n**特点:**\n- 人类主导修改\n- Cursor 提案辅助",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "runtime",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⚙️ **RUNTIME**\n**AI运行数据**\n\n**内容:**\n- 🗂️ notes/\n- 🧬 cards/\n- ⚖️ audits/\n- 📝 drafts/ (AI生成草稿)\n- 🧠 embeddings/\n\n**特点:**\n- AI可写入 notes/cards/audits/drafts\n- Drafts经Human审核后可入Cabinet",
      "x": -200,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "tools",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🔧 **TOOLS**\n**工具与基础设施**\n\n**内容:**\n- 🐳 Docker (Dify/n8n)\n- 🖥️ Local 3090\n- 🐍 scripts\n- pipeline / CLI\n\n**特点:**\n- 独立运行\n- 不依赖 Cabinet 或 Runtime",
      "x": 450,
      "y": -150,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "mirrorcore",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "💎 **Mirror Core / Agent**\n**AI智能体**\n\n**能力:**\n- Memory Orchestration\n- Knowledge Synthesis\n- Personal Agent\n- 接口层",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "user",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "👤 **Human User**\n\n**工作方式:**\n- ✍️ 使用 Obsidian 写作\n- 🛡️ 管理 Cabinet\n- 📐 设计 System\n\n**AI是辅助工具**",
      "x": -850,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
